        "text": "Watchin\u2019 Videos on the Web\nThe Internet has become a clearinghouse for just about any type of video content\nyou can imagine (and even some you couldn\u2019t imagine if you tried). From silly\nYouTube web clips to the myriad of video streaming services such as Netflix, there\nare lots of sites to keep you entertained.\nIN THIS CHAPTER\n\u00bb\n\u00bb  Watching online and downloaded\nvideos\n\u00bb\n\u00bb  Watching DVDs\n\u00bb\n\u00bb  Creating and modifying high-powered\ngraphics with GIMP\n\u00bb\n\u00bb  Playing 3D games\n274   PART 3 Getting Things Done\nYour Linux system has the ability through the Firefox web browser (see\nChapter  10) to display lots of different types of streaming video, but unfortu-\nnately, not all of them by default.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Firefox video support\n\u2022 Getting even more video support\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
